  "description": "Running Boards Replacement for 2007-2018 Jeep Wrangler JK 2 Door.\nOEDRO running boards make it easier and safer to enter and exit your vehicle. When you’re tired, climbing into a truck feels like climbing a mountain. Boards also help prevent paint scratches on the side of your car. They protect your vehicle from the debris that gets kicked up when driving on rough terrain.\nFeatures\nAnti-rust. Coated with a unique powder coating, suitable for carbon steel anti-rust.\nEasy to clean. The geometric plate panel prevents mud splashing and is easy to clean.\nPre-welded bracket. Contains the minimum parts required for quick and easy installation. No need to cut and drill.\nUnique Drop step design. The black + red design of the running board has a 3.5-inch drop, which provides better convenience for the elderly and children.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2007-2018 Jeep Wrangler JK 2 Door.",
